# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Workspace coexistence finding recorded 2026-09-13 (T-05 re-dispatch run)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# mizchi/mars@0.3.12 (selection §⑤ pin) requires moonbitlang/async@0.21.3,
# whose http.Request.headers type changed from Map[String, String] to
# Map[CaseInsensitiveString, String]. A moon workspace resolves ONE version
# per registry package across all members (`moon -C moon_ua_parser_crescent
# tree` shows bobzhang/crescent@0.11.1 resolving to async@0.21.3 although
# its own pin is 0.20.3), so bobzhang/crescent@0.11.1 (and, Windows-only,
# mizchi/x@0.6.1's Int-returning fd() accessors) do not compile in the
# shared graph as published. Local, gitignored .mooncakes adaptation
# patches (behavior-preserving, each marked "LOCAL CACHE PATCH" in place)
# were applied so the workspace builds green; the exact patch register and
# the reproducibility caveat (fresh checkout needs the same patches, e.g.
# via a CI post-fetch step or vendoring — T-06/owner decision) are in
# docs/evidence/task-reports/task-5-report.md.
